1
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
"Bittersweet Love"

2
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:38,000
(Episode 11)

3
00:02:15,541 --> 00:02:16,666
This is hard to explain.

4
00:02:19,958 --> 00:02:21,678
So I asked them to come see for themselves.

5
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:29,333
Lu Xiaofan, get out here!

6
00:02:36,583 --> 00:02:37,583
That's right.

7
00:02:39,791 --> 00:02:41,583
I am living with Lu Xiaofan.

8
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,583
Lu Xiaofan, get over here.

9
00:02:47,541 --> 00:02:50,333
Lu Xiaofan, I hate you, Lu Xiaofan.

10
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,833
Lu Xiaofan, I hate you.

11
00:02:53,875 --> 00:02:55,635
Have you made enough of a scene?

12
00:03:04,458 --> 00:03:06,083
You gonna watch me change too?

13
00:03:14,291 --> 00:03:16,375
Lu Xiaofan, I hate you.

14
00:03:18,250 --> 00:03:20,875
I hate you, Lu Xiaofan.

15
00:03:24,041 --> 00:03:25,416
I hate you.

16
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:34,666
I hate you.

17
00:03:35,125 --> 00:03:36,125
Enough.

18
00:03:36,875 --> 00:03:38,355
If you need to hate someone, hate me.

19
00:03:52,666 --> 00:03:56,333
Can this wait till I get back?

20
00:03:57,541 --> 00:03:58,875
I have urgent business today.

21
00:04:00,166 --> 00:04:01,625
What is this supposed to be?

22
00:04:01,666 --> 00:04:03,375
Could anything matter more?

23
00:04:04,291 --> 00:04:06,666
When have the Beis wronged you?

24
00:04:09,083 --> 00:04:11,791
All your family's savings
are with Lu Xiaoping.

25
00:04:12,375 --> 00:04:13,208
The market opens today.

26
00:04:13,208 --> 00:04:15,791
If I don't go,
you're all in big trouble.

27
00:04:17,166 --> 00:04:17,916
Dad...
Calm down.

28
00:04:18,958 --> 00:04:20,790
It's still unclear what went on.

29
00:04:20,791 --> 00:04:21,874
Something huge's going down today.

30
00:04:21,875 --> 00:04:23,208
Let's talk tonight, alright?

31
00:04:23,541 --> 00:04:24,541
Oh, honestly.

32
00:04:25,541 --> 00:04:26,541
Alright, Lüxin.

33
00:04:26,833 --> 00:04:28,000
Just calm down.

34
00:04:28,666 --> 00:04:29,746
Wait till Lüqing gets back.

35
00:04:30,416 --> 00:04:31,958
He'll give us all an explanation.

36
00:04:35,875 --> 00:04:38,541
Lüqing, let's go then.

37
00:04:42,958 --> 00:04:44,125
Get this house cleaned up.

38
00:04:45,208 --> 00:04:46,608
I'll deal with you when I get back.

39
00:05:02,625 --> 00:05:03,625
Good work, everyone.
Hand over your phones.

40
00:05:15,083 --> 00:05:16,333
Have everyone unplug the lines.

41
00:05:26,041 --> 00:05:27,291
It's dropped to 900.

42
00:05:27,375 --> 00:05:28,375
We're making a killing.

43
00:05:47,666 --> 00:05:48,500
Mr. Li.

44
00:05:48,583 --> 00:05:49,790
We made a killing this time.

45
00:05:49,791 --> 00:05:51,000
We can keep partnering up.

46
00:05:52,250 --> 00:05:53,291
Are you playing me?

47
00:05:55,833 --> 00:05:57,416
Corn's down.

48
00:05:57,541 --> 00:05:58,083
Down?
Lu Xiaoping.

49
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,333
Are you blind?

50
00:06:00,833 --> 00:06:01,625
Didn't you see.

51
00:06:01,626 --> 00:06:04,958
C511 corn hit 2,440 yuan?

52
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:12,833
Corn's up?

53
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:14,958
How is that possible?

54
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,874
That can't be true!

55
00:06:26,875 --> 00:06:27,791
Why's mine down

56
00:06:27,792 --> 00:06:29,000
but yours up?

57
00:06:52,916 --> 00:06:53,916
What?

58
00:06:54,583 --> 00:06:56,458
Our little financial genius

59
00:06:56,833 --> 00:06:57,625
didn't even realize

60
00:06:57,626 --> 00:07:00,000
he's only trading on a demo!

61
00:07:03,458 --> 00:07:04,458
It's all over.

62
00:07:05,416 --> 00:07:07,016
I can't afford this loss for a lifetime.

63
00:07:13,416 --> 00:07:15,541
Isn't Li Wenxi one of our top clients?

64
00:07:16,541 --> 00:07:18,040
Why team up with Bei Lüqing

65
00:07:18,041 --> 00:07:19,041
to take down Li Wenxi?

66
00:07:19,916 --> 00:07:21,458
That's how this market works.

67
00:07:22,416 --> 00:07:23,666
Everyone here's just fish.

68
00:07:25,166 --> 00:07:26,875
Big fish eat small fish some days,

69
00:07:28,083 --> 00:07:29,723
small fish take down big ones other days.

70
00:07:33,250 --> 00:07:34,500
For every winner,

71
00:07:35,666 --> 00:07:36,791
there's a loser.

72
00:07:40,458 --> 00:07:41,750
You fatten the fish

73
00:07:42,708 --> 00:07:44,000
just to eat it.

74
00:07:52,583 --> 00:07:55,166
In-laws, you owe us an explanation.

75
00:07:55,458 --> 00:07:57,500
Xiaofan's just a country boy,

76
00:07:57,791 --> 00:07:58,875
clueless about everything.

77
00:07:59,250 --> 00:08:00,708
Your son dragged him into

78
00:08:00,916 --> 00:08:02,833
all these dirty schemes.

79
00:08:03,208 --> 00:08:06,708
What do you mean our kid
dragged Xiaofan into this filth?

80
00:08:07,041 --> 00:08:08,249
Which eye of yours saw

81
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:09,916
our kid started this?

82
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,165
From our view,

83
00:08:11,166 --> 00:08:13,333
your kid was the more eager one.

84
00:08:13,375 --> 00:08:15,208
He's always hanging around Lüqing.

85
00:08:15,291 --> 00:08:16,500
Everyone knows that.

86
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,625
Xiaofan

87
00:08:18,833 --> 00:08:21,125
is shyer than an ant.

88
00:08:21,291 --> 00:08:22,750
How could he lead your son astray?

89
00:08:23,333 --> 00:08:24,333
Not to mention

90
00:08:24,416 --> 00:08:25,500
your own daughter

91
00:08:25,833 --> 00:08:27,374
got pregnant before tying the knot.

92
00:08:27,375 --> 00:08:28,958
How good can your son really be?

93
00:08:29,041 --> 00:08:31,458
Lu Zhenxing, be reasonable for once.

94
00:08:31,625 --> 00:08:33,333
What did Lüxin ever do to you?

95
00:08:33,375 --> 00:08:35,625
It is your son that has wronged our Lüxin.

96
00:08:35,791 --> 00:08:37,351
And you are shifting all blame onto us.

97
00:08:37,458 --> 00:08:38,250
Besides,

98
00:08:38,251 --> 00:08:39,415
What kind of father-in-law

99
00:08:39,416 --> 00:08:41,016
speaks of his daughter-in-law like this?

100
00:08:41,208 --> 00:08:43,541
You are uneducated and ill-mannered.

101
00:08:44,416 --> 00:08:45,416
Pah.

102
00:08:45,458 --> 00:08:46,665
You're the one with no manners at all.

103
00:08:46,666 --> 00:08:47,250
You know what,

104
00:08:47,541 --> 00:08:49,415
you—you're nothing but a dirty old man.

105
00:08:49,416 --> 00:08:51,290
Like father, like son.

106
00:08:51,291 --> 00:08:52,332
Shameless.

107
00:08:52,333 --> 00:08:53,540
You're the dirty old man.

108
00:08:53,541 --> 00:08:54,665
How dare you insult my father!

109
00:08:54,666 --> 00:08:55,666
You...

110
00:09:00,083 --> 00:09:01,250
So what do you suggest?

111
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:05,000
What do you suggest? You pay up.

112
00:09:06,166 --> 00:09:07,166
How much?

113
00:09:08,750 --> 00:09:09,750
How much?

114
00:09:22,375 --> 00:09:23,790
Sir! Sir!

115
00:09:23,791 --> 00:09:25,000
Please don't barge in.

116
00:09:34,041 --> 00:09:35,041
Bei Lüqing.

117
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:37,625
Why did you trick me?

118
00:09:39,208 --> 00:09:41,958
Every family in Lujia
Village has gone bankrupt.

119
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
What?

120
00:09:49,125 --> 00:09:51,000
Did I tell you to open secret accounts

121
00:09:51,458 --> 00:09:53,375
and trade on my tips?

122
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:56,082
Did I tell you to sell my stock tips

123
00:09:56,083 --> 00:09:57,125
to others?

124
00:09:59,041 --> 00:10:00,561
Honestly, if you'd played it straight,

125
00:10:01,333 --> 00:10:02,333
I wouldn't mind

126
00:10:02,416 --> 00:10:03,582
spending ten thousand yuan monthly

127
00:10:03,583 --> 00:10:05,125
on your minor stock bets.

128
00:10:06,333 --> 00:10:08,291
The one who ruined the Lu family

129
00:10:08,541 --> 00:10:09,541
isn't me.

130
00:10:10,083 --> 00:10:12,250
It's you yourself, Lu Xiaoping.

131
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,500
Xiaoping.

132
00:10:19,666 --> 00:10:21,416
You lost the 100,000?

133
00:10:23,041 --> 00:10:25,041
I-I still have a bit left!

134
00:10:25,791 --> 00:10:27,500
How much is this "a bit"?

135
00:10:30,250 --> 00:10:31,291
A few thousand.

136
00:10:35,708 --> 00:10:36,708
Mom.

137
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:38,666
No matter what, you've gotta help me out.

138
00:10:38,916 --> 00:10:39,916
Mom.

139
00:10:42,083 --> 00:10:43,208
It's all gone.

140
00:10:44,291 --> 00:10:45,333
All of it's gone.

141
00:10:45,791 --> 00:10:46,791
You deserved it.

142
00:10:47,791 --> 00:10:48,875
You want money, is that it?

143
00:10:49,875 --> 00:10:51,041
A hundred grand enough?

144
00:10:58,541 --> 00:10:59,625
You wanted payback, right?

145
00:11:00,666 --> 00:11:01,791
A hundred grand

146
00:11:03,875 --> 00:11:05,416
should buy Lu Xiaofan, yeah?

147
00:11:06,208 --> 00:11:07,208
From now on, Lu Xiaofan

148
00:11:07,458 --> 00:11:09,208
severs all ties with your Lu clan.

149
00:11:09,916 --> 00:11:11,750
Lu Xiaofan's only himself now.

150
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,000
He's no longer one of your Lu family.

151
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,625
If you agree, take the money.

152
00:11:23,583 --> 00:11:24,583
Lüqing.

153
00:11:25,291 --> 00:11:26,458
What you're doing...

154
00:11:29,791 --> 00:11:31,875
You and Xiaofan were wrong from day one.

155
00:11:32,666 --> 00:11:34,500
Money can't buy this off.

156
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,124
As long as the Lus are all willing,

157
00:11:37,125 --> 00:11:38,125
that's enough, right?

158
00:11:38,958 --> 00:11:39,958
Mom.

159
00:11:40,291 --> 00:11:41,291
Mom.

160
00:11:44,541 --> 00:11:45,541
Lu Zhenxing.

161
00:11:47,625 --> 00:11:49,250
If you dare cash that check,

162
00:11:49,833 --> 00:11:50,500
from today forward,

163
00:11:50,501 --> 00:11:52,267
I'll never darken your
Lu family's door again.

164
00:11:52,291 --> 00:11:52,708
Mom.

165
00:11:52,709 --> 00:11:54,541
I was wrong, truly.

166
00:11:54,625 --> 00:11:56,915
Save me, please! Save me!

167
00:11:56,916 --> 00:11:58,316
No one else pays for your mistakes.

168
00:11:58,958 --> 00:12:00,875
You reap what you sow.

169
00:12:01,458 --> 00:12:02,875
It's your mistake.

170
00:12:03,166 --> 00:12:05,000
Why should he cover for you?

171
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:08,958
No.

172
00:12:09,208 --> 00:12:10,916
I can't help you this time.

173
00:12:12,375 --> 00:12:14,874
I can't pay a hundred grand.

174
00:12:14,875 --> 00:12:16,540
Give the villagers your life!

175
00:12:16,541 --> 00:12:17,333
No, Mom, please.

176
00:12:17,375 --> 00:12:19,583
That's the villagers' life savings.

177
00:12:19,666 --> 00:12:21,374
Forcing Pingping to die for them

178
00:12:21,375 --> 00:12:22,458
won't fix anything.

179
00:12:23,666 --> 00:12:24,666
Besides,

180
00:12:24,916 --> 00:12:26,250
this is all they owe us.

181
00:12:26,416 --> 00:12:27,458
A fine young boy,

182
00:12:27,625 --> 00:12:28,750
and they destroyed him.

183
00:12:28,958 --> 00:12:30,083
Don't they owe compensation?

184
00:12:49,958 --> 00:12:50,958
Dad.

185
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:52,791
Take it.

186
00:13:02,416 --> 00:13:03,416
Consider this money

187
00:13:03,875 --> 00:13:05,416
a loan from Lüqing.

188
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:09,250
In the future,

189
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,833
I'll pay him back slowly.

190
00:13:13,791 --> 00:13:14,791
Mom.

191
00:13:15,291 --> 00:13:16,291
Dad.

192
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:21,458
Ever since I was a kid, I've never done

193
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:23,708
anything to make you happy.

194
00:13:25,375 --> 00:13:26,655
From now on, I won't be able to,

195
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,708
I'm afraid...

196
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:33,375
Xiaofan.

197
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:35,458
Xiaofan.

198
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:37,666
I see it clearly now.

199
00:13:38,958 --> 00:13:40,625
Your son wants to sever ties with you.

200
00:13:41,666 --> 00:13:43,083
Lu Xiaofan's awful

201
00:13:43,666 --> 00:13:44,666
and low,

202
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:47,750
yet ten of him still aren't
half as repulsive as you.

203
00:13:48,166 --> 00:13:49,166
Perfect.

204
00:13:49,791 --> 00:13:50,958
No more seeing each other.

205
00:13:53,916 --> 00:13:55,083
Is that what you mean?

206
00:13:56,125 --> 00:13:57,208
Is that what you mean?

207
00:14:05,041 --> 00:14:06,666
Take this hundred grand,

208
00:14:07,541 --> 00:14:09,708
and Xiaofan's done with your Lu family.

209
00:14:10,291 --> 00:14:11,708
You can't touch him, not at all.

210
00:14:19,666 --> 00:14:21,416
I get what Xiaofan means.

211
00:14:30,541 --> 00:14:32,083
Honey.

212
00:14:34,041 --> 00:14:35,250
Let's go.

213
00:14:35,541 --> 00:14:36,875
Mom, let's go.

214
00:14:41,625 --> 00:14:42,625
Mom, take it easy.

215
00:14:46,375 --> 00:14:47,915
Things have gotten this far,

216
00:14:47,916 --> 00:14:49,416
and we're all to blame.

217
00:14:50,541 --> 00:14:52,125
Once everyone's calmed down,

218
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,458
we'll talk.

219
00:14:57,291 --> 00:14:58,791
Sorry for all the trouble.

220
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:20,500
Mom.

221
00:15:23,625 --> 00:15:24,666
Mom.

222
00:15:24,916 --> 00:15:26,333
This is money I've saved up.

223
00:15:26,708 --> 00:15:28,666
Take it, for the road.

224
00:15:31,541 --> 00:15:32,541
Who cares?

225
00:15:33,416 --> 00:15:34,434
From now on, the Lu family

226
00:15:34,458 --> 00:15:35,666
disowns you as our son.

227
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,660
Let's just pretend

228
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:39,750
we never had you.

229
00:15:42,208 --> 00:15:43,208
Mom.

230
00:15:43,833 --> 00:15:44,541
He's likely

231
00:15:44,542 --> 00:15:46,165
teaming up with Bei Lüqing on purpose

232
00:15:46,166 --> 00:15:47,166
to frame me.

233
00:15:48,333 --> 00:15:49,375
I only found out today

234
00:15:49,875 --> 00:15:50,750
that Bei Lüqing, in the futures market,

235
00:15:50,751 --> 00:15:51,875
took huge corn positions

236
00:15:52,208 --> 00:15:53,415
and made a fortune.

237
00:15:53,416 --> 00:15:55,333
But he lied telling me he'd short corn.

238
00:15:59,916 --> 00:16:01,916
You're stupid, and greedier than anyone.

239
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,500
You don't know how to be decent.

240
00:16:08,208 --> 00:16:10,083
If you hadn't caused chaos everywhere,

241
00:16:10,125 --> 00:16:11,791
would Bei Lüqing frame you?

242
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:15,750
If it weren't for your mess,

243
00:16:17,916 --> 00:16:19,000
Xiaofan...

244
00:16:21,791 --> 00:16:22,208
Xiaofan.

245
00:16:22,209 --> 00:16:23,583
He's stuck this way,

246
00:16:23,875 --> 00:16:26,541
treated like a woman by a man.

247
00:16:35,916 --> 00:16:36,916
Mom.

248
00:16:38,583 --> 00:16:39,750
Forget it.

249
00:16:40,041 --> 00:16:41,250
Take brother home first.

250
00:16:42,083 --> 00:16:43,375
He leaked false intel,

251
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:45,916
so he can't stay in town now.

252
00:16:50,125 --> 00:16:51,125
Mom.

253
00:16:51,291 --> 00:16:53,166
You'd better take this money.

254
00:17:02,583 --> 00:17:03,583
Xiaofan.

255
00:17:04,375 --> 00:17:06,000
You've done more than enough.

256
00:17:06,791 --> 00:17:08,208
The Lu family dragged you down.

257
00:17:09,166 --> 00:17:12,083
From now on, do whatever you want.

258
00:17:13,541 --> 00:17:14,583
I won't stop you,

259
00:17:14,791 --> 00:17:15,875
I can't.

260
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:20,375
Take good care of yourself.

261
00:17:22,625 --> 00:17:24,416
We'll leave you alone for good.

262
00:17:26,791 --> 00:17:27,791
Mom.

263
00:18:00,541 --> 00:18:03,166
With all this family mess,

264
00:18:03,541 --> 00:18:05,083
as your dad,

265
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,740
I'll take responsibility first.

266
00:18:08,333 --> 00:18:09,958
I failed in my duties

267
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:13,708
as guardian,

268
00:18:14,166 --> 00:18:17,250
letting all this happen to our family.

269
00:18:18,041 --> 00:18:19,583
I hope you can understand

270
00:18:19,625 --> 00:18:20,875
how we feel as parents

271
00:18:21,250 --> 00:18:24,583
seeing you like this.

272
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:27,540
I hope you can understand

273
00:18:27,541 --> 00:18:29,333
how your parents feel.

274
00:18:30,666 --> 00:18:32,416
We don't live

275
00:18:32,583 --> 00:18:34,250
just for ourselves.

276
00:18:34,375 --> 00:18:36,958
We also have our place in society

277
00:18:37,083 --> 00:18:38,416
and our family duties.

278
00:18:43,041 --> 00:18:44,374
Since Lüqing

279
00:18:44,375 --> 00:18:46,083
thinks well

280
00:18:46,333 --> 00:18:47,500
of Miss Song,

281
00:18:48,541 --> 00:18:50,875
you should get married soon.

282
00:18:54,166 --> 00:18:55,375
As for Xiaofan,

283
00:18:57,083 --> 00:18:59,208
I still hope you and Lüxin

284
00:18:59,625 --> 00:19:00,625
give it another shot.

285
00:19:02,583 --> 00:19:04,166
After all, I want

286
00:19:04,375 --> 00:19:05,375
both of you to find

287
00:19:05,376 --> 00:19:06,750
where you truly belong.

288
00:19:07,333 --> 00:19:09,958
Why should I give it another shot
with this pervert?

289
00:19:10,083 --> 00:19:10,666
Lüxin.

290
00:19:10,875 --> 00:19:12,708
They're in this mess now,

291
00:19:13,208 --> 00:19:15,083
and you share some blame too, don't you?

292
00:19:18,041 --> 00:19:19,833
Then why'd you call me over to see this?

293
00:19:26,541 --> 00:19:28,291
I want a divorce from Lüxin.

294
00:19:34,625 --> 00:19:36,291
If you're set on divorcing Lüxin,

295
00:19:37,041 --> 00:19:39,166
you have to leave the Bei residence at once

296
00:19:39,375 --> 00:19:41,416
and get out of Yunjing entirely.

297
00:19:43,291 --> 00:19:44,500
And from now on,

298
00:19:45,708 --> 00:19:48,000
you're forbidden all contact with Lüqing.

299
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,583
Can you do this?

300
00:20:09,708 --> 00:20:10,708
Yes, I can.

301
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,750
Then I want to go abroad.

302
00:20:24,583 --> 00:20:25,750
That's for the best.

303
00:20:27,166 --> 00:20:28,246
I'll arrange it right away.

304
00:20:52,041 --> 00:20:53,041
Lu Xiaofan.

305
00:20:57,583 --> 00:21:00,625
All these years you've hung around me,

306
00:21:03,333 --> 00:21:04,625
