307
00:21:29,416 --> 00:21:30,416
I guess

308
00:21:37,833 --> 00:21:40,208
it's 'cause you've always doted on me.

309
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:54,750
Xiaofan.

310
00:21:56,083 --> 00:21:57,249
Tomorrow I'll send someone

311
00:21:57,250 --> 00:21:58,083
