to get your belongings.

312
00:22:12,791 --> 00:22:13,958
I called you here,

313
00:22:14,291 --> 00:22:15,291
not my brother.

314
00:22:18,625 --> 00:22:19,625
Lüxin.

315
00:22:20,625 --> 00:22:21,625
I'm sorry.

316
00:22:23,291 --> 00:22:24,333
Don't worry.

317
00:22:25,208 --> 00:22:26,666
After all,

318
00:22:28,708 --> 00:22:29,908
