319
00:22:30,625 --> 00:22:31,625
Lüxin.

320
00:22:33,875 --> 00:22:35,500
I'm here to tell you.

321
00:22:36,458 --> 00:22:38,583
Don't think leaving lets
you see my brother freely.

322
00:22:39,750 --> 00:22:40,458
If you leave,

323
00:22:40,459 --> 00:22:42,541
