go abroad for years.

324
00:22:43,916 --> 00:22:44,916
Don't wait for him.

325
00:22:45,166 --> 00:22:46,166
I understand.

326
00:22:46,791 --> 00:22:47,833
I understand.

327
00:22:49,500 --> 00:22:51,583
Your brother will wed Miss Song shortly.

328
00:22:53,166 --> 00:22:54,708
He won't come looking for me.

329
00:22:56,458 --> 00:22:58,541
The way you speak is so annoying,
do you know?

330
00:22:58,541 --> 00:22:59,250
Sorry.

331
00:22:59,251 --> 00:23:00,999
Look at you, so pathetic and spineless.

332
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,250
Sorry to disappoint you.

333
00:23:04,458 --> 00:23:05,125
You turning into a pervert

334
00:23:05,126 --> 00:23:06,500
has nothing to do with me.

335
00:23:08,250 --> 00:23:09,250
Yes.

336
00:23:09,875 --> 00:23:10,875
So,

337
00:23:11,083 --> 00:23:12,666
