338
00:23:15,291 --> 00:23:16,333
You're dreaming!

339
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,208
Why would I feel guilty toward you?

340
00:23:22,333 --> 00:23:23,208
And I never intended

341
00:23:23,209 --> 00:23:24,541
