342
00:23:26,791 --> 00:23:27,250
So...

343
00:23:27,625 --> 00:23:29,375
Divorcing me is the best thing for you.

344
00:23:31,375 --> 00:23:32,666
I'll sign that agreement.

345
00:23:42,541 --> 00:23:44,375
My dad was actually pretty polite to you.

346
00:23:46,333 --> 00:23:47,373
Don't hold it against him.

347
00:23:48,583 --> 00:23:49,583
I understand.

348
00:23:51,333 --> 00:23:52,333
Goodbye.

349
00:23:52,708 --> 00:23:53,708
Lu Xiaofan.

350
00:24:21,291 --> 00:24:22,291
