352
00:25:48,833 --> 00:25:50,458
This is the passport I arranged for you.

353
00:25:51,250 --> 00:25:52,416
This is the plane ticket.

354
00:25:54,916 --> 00:25:58,083
Leave here at 3 p.m. tomorrow,
