357
00:26:11,166 --> 00:26:12,166
No, Uncle Bei.

358
00:26:13,375 --> 00:26:14,500
Thank you for your trouble.

359
00:26:17,291 --> 00:26:18,500
Then I won't say more.

360
00:26:19,458 --> 00:26:20,500
Take care.

361
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:31,000
Let's go.

362
00:27:17,666 --> 00:27:20,166
