puts it three days early.

363
00:27:20,375 --> 00:27:22,458
Today potatoes will
drop under the floor price.

364
00:27:24,333 --> 00:27:26,458
Told you Master Bei's judgment was right.

365
00:27:26,791 --> 00:27:28,291
Just wait to cash in.

366
00:27:30,958 --> 00:27:31,666
It's dropping!
Oh my god.

367
00:27:32,541 --> 00:27:33,541
