386
00:28:24,666 --> 00:28:25,583
We opened too early.

387
00:28:25,584 --> 00:28:27,750
Any rally and we'd lose big.

388
00:28:36,083 --> 00:28:37,749
Attention passengers

389
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:40,083
for flight YG1213 to Porto.

390
00:28:40,500 --> 00:28:42,916
Final boarding call for your flight.

391
00:28:43,416 --> 00:28:46,166
Please proceed to boarding gate at once.

392
00:28:47,833 --> 00:28:49,708
Once the opening-up news hits,

393
00:28:50,125 --> 00:28:51,166
