Cut losses!

401
00:30:02,125 --> 00:30:02,833
I want to sell, we're in profit!

402
00:30:02,834 --> 00:30:04,034
We made money, I want to sell!

403
00:30:04,291 --> 00:30:05,250
Let me! Let me go first!

404
00:30:05,251 --> 00:30:06,541
Me first! I want to sell!

405
00:30:06,625 --> 00:30:07,541
I want to sell! Me first!
Give it to me! Give it to me!

406
00:30:08,376 --> 00:30:10,415
Me first! Me first! Me first!

407
00:30:10,416 --> 00:30:11,416
Me first!

408
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:13,083
